      "created_at": "2011-08-25T06:02:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In our game tonight we ran into an interesting question regarding cards that increase damage.</p>\n<p>If a card increases the damage of another card does it increase all the damage by 1 or does it increase each type of damage?</p>\n<p>The situation we ran into was Legacy’s power increasing all Hero damage and Fanatics power that causes 1 Melee and 1 Radiant damage.</p>\n<p>Does it cause 2 Melee and 2 Radiant or does it cause 1 Melee and 1 Radiant and 1 additional?</p>\n<p>Just was wondering as it was not very clear to us.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:42.318Z",
