      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/e95f7d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-26T03:58:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No Wonder We have been having such Problems with Citizen Dawn.  When you Apply Damage Modifiers like that with Haka( +1 for each card from Savage Mana) it is real easy to get damage up there. Perhaps you could give a few more examples in the FAQ,</p>\n<p>Hedge</p>",
