      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/slendertroll/{size}/2832_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-26T04:03:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hedge, my understanding is that if it says, “# damage per [whatever],” they are each a separate attack, and therefore subject to stacking bonuses/penalties. If it says, “X damage, where X = [whatever],” then it’s just one attack, and you may only apply modifiers once.</p>",
